{"id":"vod_bf_16919","vodId":"16919","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"金钱掌控","name_cn":"金钱掌控","date":"2011-01-01","year":"2011","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-18/238992894de560267f2f6f345c6a7d76.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在遥远的未来时代，日本财政陷入了巨大的危机之中，就在国家即将崩溃之时，一个名为“Sovereign Wealth Fund”的金融机构出现，成功的挽救了摇摇欲坠的日本。尽管经济危机得到了缓解，但城市却因长久以来的缺乏管理而陷入了混乱，失业率、自杀率和犯罪率急速上升。　　余贺公麿（内山昂辉 配音）的母亲早逝，父亲亦不知所踪，在舅母的抚养下长大成人的他就读于经济学部。家庭温暖的缺失让公麿十分渴望能够拥有一个稳定的家，某一日，他在银行中遇见了一位神秘的男子真坂木（樱井孝宏 配音），男子以公麿的未来作为抵押，借给了公麿大量金钱，公麿就此进入了异空间“金融街”，在那里，有许多和他一样失去了未来的人们，靠着战斗来实现各自的梦想。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-10 04:48:49","playable":true,"episodeCount":11,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jinqianzhangkong/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jinqianzhangkong/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jinqianzhangkong/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jinqianzhangkong/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jinqianzhangkong/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jinqianzhangkong/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jinqianzhangkong/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jinqianzhangkong/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jinqianzhangkong/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jinqianzhangkong/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jinqianzhangkong/第11集/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:36:06.300Z"}